    "name": "Drop It: Block Paradise! Builder Edition",
    "steam_appid": 2894250,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.poster.avif?t=1742844192\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.webm?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.mp4?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Objective:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the Star safely to the Ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on other Blocks to remove them or interact with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let Gravity and Physics do its work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.poster.avif?t=1742844192\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.webm?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.mp4?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Editor &amp; Online Levels:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Level Sizes and Visual Styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various fun Game Mechanics (Hazards, Bombs, Moving Platforms, Portals &amp; More)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make fun, creative and exciting levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload and Share your level with others online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play levels made by others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/157f8b9c9db663b6e5088d60fcb6fbdd.poster.avif?t=1742844192\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/157f8b9c9db663b6e5088d60fcb6fbdd.webm?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/157f8b9c9db663b6e5088d60fcb6fbdd.mp4?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Starter Levels to play - Giving you chance to learn the mechanics and have some fun. 50 of them will be remixed from the original game with 50 brand new ones made for Builder Edition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 Bonus Levels - Even more free levels to enjoy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor: Create and share your own unique levels with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Database: Play more levels online from around the world from strangers and friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played locally with friend with 2 controllers for puzzle co-op solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Saves - Sync up your levels across devices as well as with the Main Version</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.poster.avif?t=1742844192\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.webm?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.mp4?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Want More? Check Out The Full Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoyed making custom Levels or playing the Online Levels and want more? Check out the full game (Drop It: Block Paradise!) to unlock the Arcade Mode &amp; Full Bonus Mode to gain 200+ more levels, a fun Versus Mode and more Achievements and unlocks. Your custom levels you made will be synced between both games so you can pick back up where you started!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.poster.avif?t=1742844192\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.webm?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.mp4?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Objective:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the Star safely to the Ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on other Blocks to remove them or interact with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let Gravity and Physics do its work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.poster.avif?t=1742844192\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.webm?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.mp4?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Editor &amp; Online Levels:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Level Sizes and Visual Styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various fun Game Mechanics (Hazards, Bombs, Moving Platforms, Portals &amp; More)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make fun, creative and exciting levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload and Share your level with others online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play levels made by others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/157f8b9c9db663b6e5088d60fcb6fbdd.poster.avif?t=1742844192\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/157f8b9c9db663b6e5088d60fcb6fbdd.webm?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/157f8b9c9db663b6e5088d60fcb6fbdd.mp4?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Starter Levels to play - Giving you chance to learn the mechanics and have some fun. 50 of them will be remixed from the original game with 50 brand new ones made for Builder Edition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 Bonus Levels - Even more free levels to enjoy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor: Create and share your own unique levels with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Database: Play more levels online from around the world from strangers and friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played locally with friend with 2 controllers for puzzle co-op solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Saves - Sync up your levels across devices as well as with the Main Version</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.poster.avif?t=1742844192\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.webm?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.mp4?t=1742844192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Want More? Check Out The Full Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoyed making custom Levels or playing the Online Levels and want more? Check out the full game (Drop It: Block Paradise!) to unlock the Arcade Mode &amp; Full Bonus Mode to gain 200+ more levels, a fun Versus Mode and more Achievements and unlocks. Your custom levels you made will be synced between both games so you can pick back up where you started!</p>",
    "short_description": "Builder Edition is all about using various physic game mechanics, like gravity, bouncy blocks, bombs and more to safely get the Stars to the ground floor to solve Physics-based Puzzle levels. Play the 150+ included levels and then try your hand at making your own and sharing them with the community!",
